      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot at desk height frames a neat and beautiful wooden writing desk beside a tall window in the soft light of late morning. A warm golden sunbeam falls diagonally across the desk, lighting floating dust motes. The desk holds a tidy stack of cream notebooks, a brass desk lamp, a small potted succulent, and a ceramic mug of pens, all neatly arranged. A cute fluffy grey cat with round green eyes and a pink nose hops up onto the desk from the left, lands softly, and walks carefully between the notebooks and the plant without disturbing anything. The cat steps into the sunbeam, turns a slow circle, and settles down, tucking its paws beneath its chest as its fur glows silver at the edges in the warm light. It half-closes its eyes and blinks slowly. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the cat. The cat lifts its head, looks toward the camera, and lets out a soft, high, sweet meow.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet room tone, the soft thump of paws landing on wood, faint padding footsteps across the desk, a gentle contented purr as the cat settles, distant birdsong through the window, then a single soft, high-pitched meow near the end.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: None."
      ],
